        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Stevens et al.",
        "AbstractText": "The genome of Vagococcus teuberi DSM 21459T, a strain isolated from Malian fermented milk, was sequenced using single-molecule real-time sequencing. The genome of V. teuberi DSM 21459T is the first sequenced genome of this novel species and the second genome among the genus Vagococcus."
